@startuml
title Browse service catalog (client app — /agendar)

actor Client
participant "NGINX" as NGINX
participant "FE (Next.js)" as FE
participant "BE (Django/DRF)" as BE
database "DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB

Client -> NGINX : GET /agendar
NGINX -> FE : proxy (static client app)
note over FE
  Public page — no auth required.
  Renders the catalog grouped by category as tabs:
  - Unhas, Estética (price + duration)
  - Laser (price only, display-only)
end note

FE -> FE : SchedulingTabs (features/services/catalog.ts)
note right of FE
  Roadmap 4.4 (current): catalog data is a STATIC
  frontend constant mirroring backend seed_data.py.
  - formatPrice(): null -> "Sob consulta"
  - bookable tabs show an "Agendar" CTA placeholder
    (real booking = roadmap 4.5, not yet wired)
  - Laser: not bookable -> "contacta João Veloso"
end note

FE --> Client : catalog UI (tabs, price/duration list)

== Planned (when booking lands — roadmap 4.4/4.5) ==
FE -[#888]-> NGINX : GET /v1/services/?category_id=...
NGINX -[#888]-> BE : proxy
note over BE
  Public, read-only catalog (AllowAny).
  selectors.list_services(active_only=True)
  ServiceSerializer -> includes effective_price
  (seasonal discount applied), is_quote_only.
end note
BE -[#888]-> DB : SELECT services (select_related category, staff)
BE -[#888]-> FE : 200 OK (serialized services)
@enduml
